silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_16_bridges_yoneda_sheaf_adj_kan_sections_04_cross_paper_bridge_kan_extensions_concrete_anchor_4_Mammal#mammal silm:hasLongDescription "The Mammal is the inferred mammal class; f:Cat->Mammal. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mammal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
